    <div class="field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden view-mode-full"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"><header id="main-content-header"><h1 ng-non-bindable="">
		<span>Defesa de TCC 2024/1</span>
	</h1>

	<h2>
		TCC 2 
	</h2>

	<ul><li>
			Felipe Bastos Chaves - Data: 06/08/2024 - Horário: 9:30 - <a data-url="https://docs.google.com/document/d/17j4hpiFqHeZDSuF1Bi0Ckc7cf1A9-znB" href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/17j4hpiFqHeZDSuF1Bi0Ckc7cf1A9-znB" target="_blank" title="">Mais detalhes</a>
		</li>
		<li>
			Pedro Augusto Silva Andrade - Data: 28/5/2024 - Horário: 20:45
		</li>
		<li>
			Mario Sergio Borges - Data: 28/5/2024 - Horário: 14:00
		</li>
		<li>
			Rafael Pires Mota - Data: 5/4/2024 - Horário: 9:00 - <a data-url="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jo_TeEKS6eS3fxhw8WWa8FK7dlae8G9x/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;ouid=116770388307327099040&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true" href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jo_TeEKS6eS3fxhw8WWa8FK7dlae8G9x/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;ouid=116770388307327099040&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true" target="_blank" title="">Mais detalhes</a>
		</li>
	</ul><h2 ng-non-bindable="">
		<span style="font-size:28px;">Defesa de TCC 2023/2</span>
	</h2>

	<h2>
		TCC 1
	</h2>

	<ul><li>
			Lucio Oliveira Martins Torres - Data: 23/2/2024 - Horário: 15:00 - <a data-url="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VWsr7MovdfIWOtKywy3Q9XYazVSVE91-KNOvBmLqW9k" href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VWsr7MovdfIWOtKywy3Q9XYazVSVE91-KNOvBmLqW9k" target="_blank" title="">Mais detalhes</a>
		</li>
		<li>
