		</li>
	</ul><h2>
		TCC 2 
	</h2>

	<ul><li>
			Thales Santos Carvalho - Data: 28/2/2024 - Horário: 17:00 - <a data-url="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1SJMnt9McpSmOgBefHXJbGQOF5l1cIonF" href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1SJMnt9McpSmOgBefHXJbGQOF5l1cIonF" target="_blank" title="">Mais detalhes</a>
		</li>
		<li>
			Fernando Silva da Rocha - Data: 22/2/2024 - Horário: 19:00 - <a data-url="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1E6unQeshLAmWYtNtspLY58gDqDbyHHB6" href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1E6unQeshLAmWYtNtspLY58gDqDbyHHB6" target="_blank" title="">Mais detalhes</a>
		</li>
